      "location": "Title and article paragraphs discussing dishonor and the wife’s choices",
      "severity": "minor",
      "source_quote": "“Dishonor and Loss”; “All wives are tempted to dishonor their husbands”; “I can choose to honor or dishonor the husband God gave me.”",
      "suggested_fix": "Use wording centered on disrespect or dishonoring rather than contempt, for example: title «الإهانة والخسارة»; «تُجرَّب جميع الزوجات على إهانة أزواجهن»; «أختار أن أكرم الزوج الذي وهبني الله إياه أو أهينه». Apply the same distinction to related occurrences where the source says “dishonor.”",
